<title>UK: Siebe tumbles after Capel downgrade.</title>
<headline>Siebe tumbles after Capel downgrade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Siebe tumbled 26-1/2p to 980-1/2p by 0927 GMT after brokerage HSBC James Capel downgraded the stock, traders said.  </p>
<p>Capel cut its recommendation to a &quot;hold&quot; from a &quot;buy,&quot; traders said.</p>
<p>Just last week, Siebe shares climbed to a record after SBC Warburg reiterated its &quot;buy&quot; rating.</p>
<p>-- Debra Sherman, London newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
